WEBVTT

00:07.785 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.985 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

02:19.385 --> 02:22.505
LOVE BEGINS ON A BITTERSWEET NOTE

02:29.545 --> 02:32.225
Why the long face? It's longer
than the filefish we serve here.

02:32.305 --> 02:34.945
Anyone who saw you
would think I'd served you fake liquor.

02:35.025 --> 02:36.585
-Save it.
-Drink with me.

02:43.825 --> 02:45.025
Trouble in love?

02:49.145 --> 02:50.425
As if.

02:54.025 --> 02:56.585
I guessed it, didn't I? So you're dating?

02:57.265 --> 02:58.825
We are,

02:58.905 --> 03:00.745
but we're keeping it secret.

03:01.425 --> 03:02.385
A secret relationship?

03:02.465 --> 03:03.865
It feels strange.

03:06.465 --> 03:08.985
Ms. Shang is a great girl.

03:09.065 --> 03:12.025
She's kind, hardworking, and dependable.

03:12.105 --> 03:13.865
And she looks at you

03:13.945 --> 03:16.145
like an adoring little fawn.

03:16.225 --> 03:17.545
What's not to like?

03:17.625 --> 03:19.865
You should at least make it official.

03:21.025 --> 03:22.465
You think I wanted to keep it secret?

03:23.945 --> 03:26.305
Whenever she sees me in public,
she avoids me like the plague,

03:26.945 --> 03:28.545
terrified someone might notice.

03:29.825 --> 03:32.745
And the two of us
can only see each other on weekends.

03:32.825 --> 03:34.185
Is that a normal relationship?

03:34.865 --> 03:36.705
It is a little unusual,

03:37.865 --> 03:39.385
but I can understand why.

03:40.505 --> 03:42.545
Ms. Shang has a strong sense of pride.

03:43.145 --> 03:44.425
She's afraid you'll look down on her

03:45.025 --> 03:48.025
and that your relationship
won't survive once it comes to light.

03:48.105 --> 03:49.745
In a way, she's protecting you.

03:50.385 --> 03:54.185
Besides, shouldn't you
be pleased that she knows

03:54.265 --> 03:57.305
how to conduct herself at work?
Why are you so bothered?

04:00.865 --> 04:02.185
She made a mistake at work.

04:03.345 --> 04:04.465
I criticized her,

04:05.065 --> 04:06.505
and she still won't talk to me.

04:14.505 --> 04:15.505
There it is.

04:16.225 --> 04:17.585
You took the scenic route

04:18.465 --> 04:19.665
to get to the point.

04:20.265 --> 04:21.545
Did you make it up to her afterward?

04:23.225 --> 04:25.425
Other big-shot bosses
protect their girlfriends.

04:25.505 --> 04:26.785
But you?

04:26.865 --> 04:29.425
All stick and no carrot.

04:29.505 --> 04:32.305
What's she getting
out of this relationship?

04:35.145 --> 04:36.305
You don't get it.

04:36.905 --> 04:38.825
If she wants to grow quickly at work,

04:38.905 --> 04:40.465
she has to solve problems herself.

04:42.305 --> 04:43.825
She understands
that this is how she'll learn.

04:44.865 --> 04:46.065
And this time,

04:46.865 --> 04:47.985
she handled it pretty well.

04:48.905 --> 04:50.065
But she was too naive.

04:50.945 --> 04:54.745
She thought being loyal at work
would earn her loyalty in return.

04:56.185 --> 04:57.425
Foolish.

04:57.505 --> 04:58.945
You just said yourself

04:59.545 --> 05:03.265
that she did some things well.

05:03.785 --> 05:07.145
Everyone makes mistakes.
Just soften a little.

05:07.945 --> 05:09.105
How about this?

05:09.185 --> 05:10.745
Forget the gifts.

05:10.825 --> 05:13.105
But starting tomorrow,
send her flowers to show you're sorry.

05:13.785 --> 05:14.825
I did nothing wrong.

05:15.345 --> 05:16.545
Why should I send flowers?

05:16.625 --> 05:18.865
It's not like anything serious
happened between you two.

05:18.945 --> 05:20.465
Why does it matter who's right or wrong?

05:21.025 --> 05:23.105
If you want this relationship to work,

05:23.185 --> 05:24.985
send her flowers and smooth things over.

05:34.025 --> 05:35.385
Will flowers really work?

05:36.665 --> 05:37.745
Of course.

05:38.425 --> 05:40.105
Women go weak at the knees for flowers.

05:40.825 --> 05:41.825
I'll arrange it.

05:41.905 --> 05:43.265
Starting tomorrow, she'll get flowers

05:43.345 --> 05:46.145
until she's no longer mad.

05:56.345 --> 05:59.185
-Hello. I'm here to see Mr. Luan.
-Just go straight ahead.

05:59.865 --> 06:00.945
Please sign here.

06:04.505 --> 06:05.905
I've got some gossip.

06:07.785 --> 06:11.105
Boss has quietly set up a love nest.

06:13.225 --> 06:14.545
Huh?

06:14.625 --> 06:15.665
With whom?

06:16.985 --> 06:17.825
Her. Look.

06:31.145 --> 06:32.065
Luan Nian!

06:37.065 --> 06:40.265
Boss rented my grandmother's
courtyard house in the hutong.

06:40.345 --> 06:41.385
When I went to hand over the keys,

06:41.985 --> 06:43.505
this gorgeous woman was staying there.

06:44.185 --> 06:46.625
Her name is Zang Yao.
She's Luke's childhood friend.

06:47.425 --> 06:50.505
The classic childhood sweetheart.

06:51.425 --> 06:52.345
Hold on.

06:53.785 --> 06:56.505
Look how elegant she is.

06:56.585 --> 06:58.905
You can tell at a glance
she and Luke move in the same circles.

06:58.985 --> 07:00.145
Look.

07:00.665 --> 07:01.905
Look at this huge cake.

07:02.545 --> 07:05.105
She ordered it from Paris

07:05.185 --> 07:07.185
for Luke's birthday three years ago.

07:07.265 --> 07:08.545
I picked it up.

07:08.625 --> 07:11.465
Back then, she was still studying abroad.

07:12.865 --> 07:14.705
This time, Boss specifically said

07:15.225 --> 07:19.385
the house had to be nice and quiet,
and he didn't even haggle over the rent.

07:19.465 --> 07:22.185
Do you think they're really dating?

07:22.785 --> 07:26.625
If they are,
that's quite something for him.

07:27.665 --> 07:32.025
Can you imagine
what a man like him will be like

07:32.625 --> 07:33.945
when he's in love?

07:34.505 --> 07:35.665
That's nice.

07:37.065 --> 07:38.385
I still have a report to finish.

07:39.025 --> 07:40.305
I'd better get back to it.

07:43.905 --> 07:45.425
Look at that cake.

07:48.105 --> 07:50.265
Lumi, these flowers are for Mr. Luan.

07:56.305 --> 07:57.705
Something's definitely up.

08:00.665 --> 08:02.545
Weren't we meeting
at Tan Mian's restaurant?

08:04.945 --> 08:07.145
I'm almost off work.
Why did you come here?

08:08.225 --> 08:09.585
To pick you up.

08:09.665 --> 08:11.865
And let you ride in my new car.

08:13.385 --> 08:15.185
You just got back.
Where did you get a car?

08:15.265 --> 08:16.865
You rented me the house,

08:16.945 --> 08:18.705
and Song and the others arranged the car.

08:21.825 --> 08:22.905
Come in.

08:28.665 --> 08:30.745
Mr. Luan, your flowers.

08:31.865 --> 08:34.465
Is this the surprise
you prepared for me tonight?

08:34.545 --> 08:35.784
They're beautiful.

08:39.185 --> 08:40.024
Lumi.

08:49.505 --> 08:50.425
Should I close the door, Mr. Luan?

08:51.265 --> 08:52.505
Thanks.

08:59.785 --> 09:00.425
LUAN NIAN

09:00.505 --> 09:01.545
Have you left?

09:39.505 --> 09:40.585
Tao.

09:44.065 --> 09:46.785
Get in. I'm driving everyone home.

09:52.705 --> 09:54.585
FATED FOR YOU

09:57.705 --> 09:58.945
Sun Yu,

09:59.025 --> 10:00.825
your company's so stingy.

10:01.345 --> 10:02.625
Such a big matchmaking event,

10:02.705 --> 10:04.385
and this beat-up
little van delivers the flowers.

10:04.465 --> 10:06.345
No wonder they say
poverty makes marriage miserable.

10:06.425 --> 10:08.585
If your members
see flowers arriving in this wreck,

10:08.665 --> 10:09.905
their dates won't stand a chance.

10:10.985 --> 10:12.865
I did my best
to uphold the company's image.

10:12.945 --> 10:14.585
Can't you see how nicely I decorated it?

10:14.665 --> 10:17.025
I'm just a beggar here,
and beggars can't be choosers.

10:17.105 --> 10:18.625
It's fine. I think it's perfectly fine.

10:20.225 --> 10:22.225
You know what?
I bought those flowers wholesale.

10:22.305 --> 10:24.785
I'll pick out some nice ones
and put them in our place.

10:26.185 --> 10:27.025
Sun Yu.

10:29.065 --> 10:30.625
Could you give me a bouquet?

10:31.465 --> 10:33.505
Of course. We've got plenty.

10:39.145 --> 10:42.145
Cheer up. It's just a bouquet.
I'll give you one.

10:42.225 --> 10:43.465
Tell me what kind you want.

10:43.545 --> 10:44.705
I'll send it to your office tomorrow.

10:44.785 --> 10:45.785
You'll see a huge bouquet

10:45.865 --> 10:48.105
right in the middle of your desk.

10:48.185 --> 10:49.385
-How's that?
-Great.

10:49.985 --> 10:50.945
What are you two doing?

10:51.025 --> 10:52.785
Am I invisible?

10:52.865 --> 10:55.105
You're sending her flowers? I'll do it.

10:56.145 --> 10:57.185
A different bouquet every day for a week.

10:57.265 --> 10:58.905
I'll outdo everyone at your office.

10:58.985 --> 11:01.745
With me around,
you'll get flowers every day.

11:01.825 --> 11:02.945
Homegrown and hand-delivered.

11:03.625 --> 11:07.345
-What are you talking about?
-A wise man once told me

11:07.425 --> 11:10.025
that if no one sends a girl flowers,
it means she has a special quality.

11:10.105 --> 11:11.105
What's that?

11:12.265 --> 11:13.505
She's naturally fragrant.

11:15.225 --> 11:16.825
Take a good sniff. What do you smell?

11:17.425 --> 11:18.545
What?

11:19.225 --> 11:20.545
-Flowers?
-Wrong!

11:20.625 --> 11:21.625
Peaches!

11:23.865 --> 11:26.625
-Right, peaches, Tao's fragrance.
-Keep your eyes on the road.

11:28.185 --> 11:32.145
FATED FOR YOU

11:47.145 --> 11:48.465
Flora, these are for you.

11:50.465 --> 11:51.825
-Thank you.
-No problem.

11:51.905 --> 11:52.825
Flora,

11:52.905 --> 11:55.105
-are you seeing someone?
-No.

11:55.745 --> 11:58.785
White lisianthus
symbolizes everlasting love.

11:59.305 --> 12:01.305
Your boyfriend is quite a romantic.

12:01.385 --> 12:02.265
Congratulations.

12:02.345 --> 12:03.345
-I don't have one.
-Who sent them?

12:03.425 --> 12:05.625
-Morning, Mr. Luan.
-Morning, Mr. Luan.

12:18.105 --> 12:19.065
HOPE THIS BRIGHTENS YOUR DAY

12:22.385 --> 12:23.785
I got the flowers.

12:23.865 --> 12:24.905
Thanks, Lei.

12:25.465 --> 12:26.225
SUNFLOWER FAMILY

12:26.305 --> 12:27.385
I haven't sent anything yet.

12:27.465 --> 12:28.825
You haven't given me your address.

12:29.505 --> 12:30.985
I didn't send them either.

12:31.585 --> 12:32.945
Was it Yuanzhu?

12:33.025 --> 12:34.225
Not me either.

12:34.305 --> 12:38.345
Looks like Tao has plenty of admirers.

12:38.425 --> 12:40.385
We should look into it.

12:40.465 --> 12:42.305
Love is in the air.

13:03.665 --> 13:05.105
Here. Your flowers.

13:05.185 --> 13:07.105
Five days in a row.

13:07.185 --> 13:08.665
Will this ever end?

13:08.745 --> 13:10.065
I just went through a breakup.

13:12.425 --> 13:13.305
What happened?

13:14.025 --> 13:16.665
He's always flirting around.
I caught him red-handed.

13:16.745 --> 13:19.465
He sent the exact same gift to two women.

13:19.545 --> 13:21.265
Of course,

13:21.345 --> 13:22.865
I dumped him.

13:23.545 --> 13:26.145
And now I have to watch you
get flowers every day. I can't take it.

13:27.505 --> 13:28.665
Lumi.

13:29.945 --> 13:32.465
Does the copy you submitted today
even make sense?

13:32.545 --> 13:33.625
Go fix it.

13:35.985 --> 13:37.185
The client needs it tomorrow.

13:41.225 --> 13:43.145
It's still early. Sneaking out already?

13:46.145 --> 13:47.065
No.

13:47.145 --> 13:50.185
I cleared it with Alex and Lumi.

13:50.265 --> 13:51.465
I'm leaving early.

13:53.465 --> 13:54.465
Where are you going?

13:56.265 --> 13:57.545
Hiking with some friends.

14:00.665 --> 14:01.985
Today's Friday.

14:05.625 --> 14:06.505
I know.

14:07.345 --> 14:09.065
We won't be back until Sunday.

14:13.505 --> 14:14.345
Have fun.

14:15.745 --> 14:16.945
Nice flowers.

14:18.705 --> 14:19.665
But they don't suit you.

14:21.945 --> 14:24.025
Then what flowers do you think suit me?

14:24.105 --> 14:25.505
Green foxtail.

14:47.785 --> 14:48.865
Let's go.

14:50.905 --> 14:53.225
What's wrong? You got flowers,
but you still seem down.

14:53.945 --> 14:55.585
-You can have them.
-Me?

15:38.305 --> 15:39.825
Watch your step, everyone.

15:43.025 --> 15:43.985
Keep up.

15:45.585 --> 15:47.065
-Let's hit the restroom.
-All right.

15:47.905 --> 15:49.505
Want water? I'll get several bottles.

15:49.585 --> 15:51.065
-Yes.
-OK.

15:51.145 --> 15:52.425
Hurry. I can't hold it much longer.

15:54.585 --> 15:56.585
Could the flowers be from Luan Nian?

15:56.665 --> 15:57.905
No way.

15:57.985 --> 15:59.865
He doesn't think I deserve flowers.

15:59.945 --> 16:01.665
Don't put yourself down like that.

16:02.345 --> 16:03.825
How many times have I told you?

16:06.785 --> 16:11.825
I wanted flowers because he gave
someone else flowers, and I got jealous.

16:17.345 --> 16:20.905
But I feel so silly,
comparing myself to her

16:20.985 --> 16:22.385
over a bouquet.

16:24.665 --> 16:25.945
You're not silly.

16:26.785 --> 16:28.705
Love makes you possessive.

16:28.785 --> 16:31.505
If you stopped feeling that way,
it'd mean you didn't love him anymore.

16:32.545 --> 16:33.625
Water. Here.

16:36.345 --> 16:37.625
Water. Here.

16:38.185 --> 16:39.065
Where did you buy it?

16:39.145 --> 16:40.305
-Let's go.
-Thanks.

16:40.385 --> 16:41.385
Aren't you two using the restroom?

16:41.465 --> 16:42.345
-Lei.
-No.

16:42.425 --> 16:43.825
-Let's start climbing.
-Come on.

16:43.905 --> 16:45.065
There won't be any restrooms up there.

16:46.865 --> 16:47.985
It's cold out here.

16:50.385 --> 16:52.105
Let me grab your backpack.
I'm getting tired.

16:53.105 --> 16:54.465
-You OK?
-Yes.

17:05.385 --> 17:06.985
It looks easier up there.

17:07.704 --> 17:08.625
Come on.

17:15.224 --> 17:17.265
Then what flowers do you think suit me?

17:18.464 --> 17:19.545
Green foxtail.

17:38.625 --> 17:39.985
What are your plans for New Year's Eve?

17:42.905 --> 17:45.665
Once the designers finalize the proposal,

17:45.745 --> 17:47.785
I'll be at the office overseeing

17:47.865 --> 17:49.785
the New Year's Eve
and New Year's Day ad launches.

17:53.145 --> 17:55.345
Do you have a passport and a snowboard?

17:56.865 --> 17:58.025
No.

18:01.385 --> 18:02.785
What's wrong? Getting tired?

18:04.345 --> 18:05.785
I just wanted a break.

18:05.865 --> 18:07.425
How do you have so much stamina?

18:07.505 --> 18:09.425
I grew up in the mountains.

18:09.505 --> 18:11.585
Climbing was the best entertainment
we had as kids.

18:12.265 --> 18:13.225
No wonder.

18:16.705 --> 18:18.425
MOM

18:19.185 --> 18:22.305
When I was little,
I only got to go hiking on school trips,

18:22.385 --> 18:24.825
but before every trip, my dad would worry

18:24.905 --> 18:27.305
that I'd fall
and keep telling me to be careful.

18:28.305 --> 18:30.265
I can tell you grew up in a happy family.

18:30.945 --> 18:32.505
You can tell?

18:32.585 --> 18:35.105
You're innocent and cheerful.

18:35.185 --> 18:37.225
It's obvious your parents doted on you.

18:38.665 --> 18:39.625
They did.

18:39.705 --> 18:43.145
I don't think I've ever had
much to complain about.

18:46.065 --> 18:48.065
The man who drove you home last time…

18:48.145 --> 18:49.425
Is he your boyfriend?

18:54.145 --> 18:55.025
Sort of.

18:57.905 --> 18:59.665
Why aren't you dating anyone?

19:01.425 --> 19:02.825
I'd rather not make some poor girl suffer.

19:03.385 --> 19:06.385
What? Why would she suffer?

19:06.465 --> 19:09.865
I think anyone who dated you
would be very happy.

19:11.105 --> 19:12.425
Dating isn't important.

19:13.825 --> 19:15.025
Being together is what matters.

19:16.225 --> 19:17.425
What are you two talking about?

19:18.025 --> 19:20.025
Tao, come on. Keep up.

19:20.105 --> 19:22.065
-We're almost there.
-Coming!

19:23.025 --> 19:24.785
-Let's go.
-All right.

19:25.905 --> 19:27.105
Here.

19:27.185 --> 19:28.425
I'll pull you along.

19:28.505 --> 19:29.825
-It's all right.
-Come on.

19:40.025 --> 19:42.705
I've already talked to Song,
Tan Mian, and the others.

19:42.785 --> 19:44.785
How about we go snowboarding
in Northern Europe

19:45.305 --> 19:46.985
for our annual trip this year?

19:47.065 --> 19:48.185
BEIJING TO ZURICH

19:50.385 --> 19:52.185
FLIGHT BOOKING PAGE

20:09.065 --> 20:12.545
The view was worth the wait.

20:13.625 --> 20:14.785
It's breathtaking.

20:29.705 --> 20:31.505
I could jump
into this sea of clouds right now.

20:36.905 --> 20:38.505
You like clouds?

20:49.385 --> 20:50.385
Let's go up there and make a wish.

20:56.665 --> 20:59.985
I hope all my clients find their match.

21:00.065 --> 21:00.985
God of Wealth, God of Marriage,

21:01.065 --> 21:03.105
please work your magic! Please!

21:06.105 --> 21:07.385
Make me rich.

21:12.585 --> 21:13.985
What did you wish for?

21:14.745 --> 21:19.265
I just wished for my career

21:19.345 --> 21:20.505
to keep getting better!

21:20.585 --> 21:22.025
Great!

21:22.105 --> 21:24.105
Let my house go up in value!

21:24.185 --> 21:25.545
-Go up!
-Go up!

21:26.145 --> 21:27.585
Yuanzhu, what did you wish for?

21:29.425 --> 21:31.865
I'll be traveling
a lot for work after New Year's.

21:31.945 --> 21:34.705
I hope my autonomous
driving tests succeed.

21:35.985 --> 21:37.225
They definitely will.

21:37.905 --> 21:39.545
We worked so hard to get up here.

21:39.625 --> 21:40.465
How about a group photo?

21:40.545 --> 21:41.265
-Sure.
-Sounds good.

21:41.345 --> 21:42.065
-Come on.
-Come.

21:42.145 --> 21:43.305
-Move closer.
-Tao.

21:43.385 --> 21:44.585
Move closer.

21:44.665 --> 21:45.745
One, two.

21:50.945 --> 21:51.825
Done.

21:51.905 --> 21:52.825
Let me be rich, please.

21:54.025 --> 21:55.465
It's getting pretty cold.

21:55.545 --> 21:57.385
Why don't we head down
and find something to eat?

21:57.465 --> 21:58.585
-Sure.
-I looked it up.

21:58.665 --> 22:00.585
The best food around here
is wood-fired chicken.

22:00.665 --> 22:02.225
-I've heard of it.
-Let's go.

22:02.305 --> 22:03.385
-Come on.
-Let's go.

22:03.465 --> 22:04.305
Yuanzhu's paying.

22:04.385 --> 22:05.425
-I'm freezing.
-Is it this way?

22:13.505 --> 22:14.945
Today is New Year's Eve.

22:15.025 --> 22:18.705
Beijing's evening rush hour
is expected to begin as early as 3 p.m.

22:18.785 --> 22:21.465
Please plan ahead if you're heading out.

22:21.545 --> 22:22.905
Public transportation is recommended.

22:32.425 --> 22:34.905
-Lumi, I'm leaving. Bye.
-I'm leaving as well.

22:34.985 --> 22:36.665
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

22:36.745 --> 22:37.825
Bye, Lumi.

22:37.905 --> 22:38.905
Take it easy. Don't drink too much.

22:42.345 --> 22:43.465
Flora,

22:45.065 --> 22:46.265
what are your plans for tonight?

22:46.865 --> 22:50.385
I want to sleep all night.
I've been exhausted lately.

22:51.225 --> 22:52.265
Boring.

22:52.345 --> 22:53.265
I'm heading out, then.

22:53.345 --> 22:55.425
Traffic will be gridlocked everywhere.
Get home early.

22:55.505 --> 22:56.825
I'll leave once the client replies.

22:58.705 --> 22:59.945
LUAN NIAN: EVERYONE CAN LEAVE EARLY TODAY

23:00.025 --> 23:01.465
No need to wait.

23:01.545 --> 23:02.945
Luke's already celebrating
New Year's in Switzerland.

23:03.625 --> 23:05.705
Let's go. No one's here
to keep tabs on us.

23:06.465 --> 23:07.625
Happy New Year.

23:07.705 --> 23:09.305
-Happy New Year.
-Go on. Get going.

23:15.665 --> 23:17.665
SWITZERLAND

23:17.745 --> 23:19.145
I'm exhausted.

23:20.145 --> 23:21.865
The snow's really good this year.

23:21.945 --> 23:23.465
-The snow's good.
-I love my new board.

23:23.545 --> 23:24.705
But I wasn't at my best today.

23:24.785 --> 23:25.785
It's amazing.

23:25.865 --> 23:27.785
You need to practice
your carving next year. Seriously.

23:27.865 --> 23:30.185
I'm scared to go too fast. You know?

23:30.265 --> 23:31.785
It requires too much speed.

23:31.865 --> 23:33.865
And when you're going downhill,
you need to crouch lower.

23:34.705 --> 23:36.945
Come over here. Stop talking.

23:37.025 --> 23:38.185
Let's take a group photo.

23:38.785 --> 23:41.905
When we're old and gray,
we can look back on it.

23:41.985 --> 23:43.745
-I'll never grow old.
-Old and gray?

23:43.825 --> 23:44.505
I'll never…

23:44.585 --> 23:46.265
-Luan Nian, what are you doing?
-Luan Nian.

23:46.345 --> 23:47.385
-Luke, photo!
-Look at the camera.

23:47.465 --> 23:48.385
Hurry.

23:48.465 --> 23:49.505
-Come on.
-Let's take it.

23:49.585 --> 23:51.185
One, two, three.

23:52.065 --> 23:53.305
-Let me see.
-Let me see.

23:54.025 --> 23:56.105
-I'm so handsome.
-We didn't get him in it.

23:56.185 --> 23:58.265
-You blocked him.
-Let's go.

24:00.025 --> 24:02.985
What are you looking at?
You weren't even in the photo.

24:03.065 --> 24:03.985
Come on.

24:05.865 --> 24:08.185
One, two, three.

24:10.625 --> 24:11.465
-Come on.
-Let's drink.

24:11.545 --> 24:12.545
Cheers.

24:13.145 --> 24:14.465
Drink up, everyone.

24:16.265 --> 24:17.145
What's on your mind?

24:17.225 --> 24:18.505
You keep sitting here alone.

24:20.025 --> 24:21.145
I haven't snowboarded much
these past two years,

24:21.225 --> 24:23.065
so I was really off today.

24:23.145 --> 24:23.985
Want anything? I'll get it for you.

24:24.065 --> 24:25.945
No, thanks. You guys eat.

24:26.025 --> 24:27.745
-Honestly…
-Don't drink alone. Come join us.

24:29.665 --> 24:30.985
You always have to butt in.

24:36.865 --> 24:37.905
Luke,

24:38.465 --> 24:40.825
why don't you two
finally make it official on this trip?

24:48.105 --> 24:50.105
Have any of your relationships
ever worked out?

24:51.225 --> 24:52.985
Sure.

24:53.865 --> 24:56.425
Just… a few too many times.

24:57.505 --> 24:58.465
With disastrous results.

24:59.625 --> 25:00.945
That's why I'm worried about you.

25:02.145 --> 25:03.185
Yao.

25:04.465 --> 25:07.945
I've always felt like you've been
hiding something these past few years.

25:08.545 --> 25:09.825
How about I drink with you tonight,

25:09.905 --> 25:10.945
and you tell me
what's really on your mind?

25:11.545 --> 25:12.785
Cheers.

25:12.865 --> 25:15.425
Any secrets between us stay between us.

25:15.505 --> 25:17.225
Why would I tell you?

25:19.465 --> 25:20.705
All I know is

25:20.785 --> 25:23.505
that we've always
been really close friends.

25:24.105 --> 25:26.305
But at the beginning,

25:26.385 --> 25:28.585
I don't think either of us
wanted to be just friends.

25:31.785 --> 25:32.625
Come on.

25:32.705 --> 25:33.625
Let's drink.

25:33.705 --> 25:34.745
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

25:36.785 --> 25:37.825
I have a girlfriend.

25:40.545 --> 25:41.385
What?

25:42.225 --> 25:43.785
Wait. You have a girlfriend?

25:43.865 --> 25:44.985
Since when?

25:45.785 --> 25:47.305
Are you serious?

25:47.385 --> 25:49.105
And you didn't even tell me?

25:49.185 --> 25:50.465
Do we know her?

25:50.545 --> 25:52.785
What's there to announce
about my love life?

25:53.945 --> 25:57.465
That's a pretty feeble excuse
for turning me down.

26:03.025 --> 26:04.225
Come on.

26:05.865 --> 26:06.905
Don't be upset.

26:06.985 --> 26:08.665
You know what Luan Nian's like.

26:09.265 --> 26:10.505
That's just how he talks.

26:13.945 --> 26:15.905
SIMPLY DELICIOUS

26:15.985 --> 26:17.745
What's wrong? What happened?

26:20.865 --> 26:22.225
I ran into my ex.

26:23.545 --> 26:25.825
He was spending
New Year's Eve with his girlfriend.

26:25.905 --> 26:27.265
And to make things worse,

26:28.465 --> 26:29.945
a coworker's event went wrong,

26:30.705 --> 26:32.505
and my boss tried
to make me take the blame.

26:34.185 --> 26:35.585
I refused,

26:35.665 --> 26:38.385
so he called me into his office
and chewed me out.

26:39.305 --> 26:41.145
There goes my year-end bonus.

26:42.025 --> 26:44.145
Don't cry, OK?

26:44.705 --> 26:47.705
Don't punish yourself
for other people's mistakes.

26:47.785 --> 26:49.665
Just ignore them.

26:49.745 --> 26:51.225
Don't you always take things in stride?

26:53.745 --> 26:54.945
But Tao,

26:56.745 --> 26:59.905
why is every step here so hard?

27:04.625 --> 27:06.825
We chose this path ourselves.

27:07.425 --> 27:08.705
You know what they say.

27:08.785 --> 27:13.865
Part of your salary
is for putting up with unfair treatment.

27:14.585 --> 27:16.185
And there's an old saying,

27:16.265 --> 27:20.065
if the road feels hard,
it's because we're going uphill.

27:20.945 --> 27:22.545
That means we're making progress,

27:22.625 --> 27:23.545
right?

27:27.865 --> 27:28.945
Right.

27:29.665 --> 27:30.865
Here.

27:30.945 --> 27:32.425
New Year's gifts for you.

27:34.585 --> 27:35.905
It's beautiful.

27:37.905 --> 27:39.185
Thank you.

27:39.265 --> 27:41.985
Oh my gosh. You even got us gifts.

27:42.705 --> 27:43.985
Thank you, Yuanzhu.

27:46.665 --> 27:50.065
The world would be a better place
with more people like you.

27:52.465 --> 27:53.865
No more bad work.

27:54.625 --> 27:56.065
No more bad men.

27:57.865 --> 27:58.705
Well…

28:02.385 --> 28:04.865
There are always
a few truly awful men in the world,

28:04.945 --> 28:06.065
of truly awful men in the world,

28:06.145 --> 28:08.585
and you just happened to meet one of them.

28:12.825 --> 28:14.705
I… I'm not good at comforting people.

28:15.705 --> 28:18.825
How about I treat you to a movie later?

28:19.345 --> 28:20.425
OK.

28:21.225 --> 28:22.665
A midnight movie?

28:23.265 --> 28:24.505
I've never been to one.

28:24.585 --> 28:26.025
Neither have I.

28:26.105 --> 28:27.065
That's a shame.

28:27.145 --> 28:30.625
When I was in school, I was always broke.

28:30.705 --> 28:32.105
So during the holidays,

28:32.185 --> 28:35.025
my classmates and I
would always go to midnight movies.

28:35.105 --> 28:36.465
Great. Let's go after dinner.

28:37.065 --> 28:38.425
-OK.
-Great.

28:40.145 --> 28:41.985
It's New Year's Eve.

28:42.065 --> 28:43.385
I should cheer up.

28:45.345 --> 28:46.225
Pull it together.

28:48.065 --> 28:50.105
Let's take a group photo
and send it to Lei.

28:50.185 --> 28:52.705
It'll commemorate
our first New Year's Eve together.

28:52.785 --> 28:54.585
-OK.
-Hold on.

28:54.665 --> 28:56.265
I brought some props.

28:56.345 --> 28:57.345
You brought props?

28:57.425 --> 28:58.625
We need to get into the New Year's spirit.

28:59.665 --> 29:00.505
This one's for you.

29:01.425 --> 29:03.185
-OK.
-And this one's for you.

29:05.265 --> 29:06.745
-Do we put them on?
-I'll show you.

29:06.825 --> 29:08.225
Put it on,

29:08.825 --> 29:10.025
like this.

29:12.865 --> 29:14.145
So childish. So childish.

29:27.065 --> 29:29.465
Why did you say that?
When did you get a girlfriend?

29:30.905 --> 29:31.825
Go check on her.

29:39.705 --> 29:41.665
How was I supposed to know
he had a girlfriend?

29:46.265 --> 29:48.385
Zang Yao, let's talk outside.

30:07.825 --> 30:09.705
Do we have to talk about this
on New Year's Eve?

30:11.185 --> 30:12.545
You know,

30:12.625 --> 30:15.665
this could ruin
every New Year's Eve for me.

30:18.225 --> 30:20.785
I don't remember ever expressing
any special feelings for you.

30:22.785 --> 30:24.505
I only wanted us to be family

30:25.265 --> 30:26.345
and best friends.

30:42.865 --> 30:44.225
I got the wrong idea.

30:47.745 --> 30:49.305
I'm sorry if I hurt you.

30:52.825 --> 30:54.105
You don't have to apologize.

30:54.945 --> 30:57.905
You're Luan Nian, after all.
Luan Nian never admits he's wrong.

31:10.785 --> 31:12.225
Do you really have a girlfriend?

31:16.105 --> 31:17.145
Yes.

31:22.505 --> 31:23.465
All right.

31:24.185 --> 31:25.585
Then I'm happy for you.

31:29.305 --> 31:31.065
I hope I haven't ruined
your New Year's Eve.

31:31.745 --> 31:33.425
You haven't.

31:34.985 --> 31:38.065
I don't know why
she isn't here with you today,

31:39.745 --> 31:42.305
but since we're here,
we should enjoy ourselves.

31:44.665 --> 31:45.625
I'm going inside.

31:55.385 --> 31:57.105
Is it almost midnight?

31:57.185 --> 31:58.025
Time for the countdown.

31:58.785 --> 31:59.905
Time for the countdown.

32:04.545 --> 32:06.065
SHANG ZHITAO

32:09.625 --> 32:10.825
Ten.

32:10.905 --> 32:11.745
Nine.

32:11.825 --> 32:12.945
Eight.

32:13.025 --> 32:14.265
Seven.

32:14.345 --> 32:15.905
Six. Five.

32:16.505 --> 32:17.345
Four.

32:17.425 --> 32:18.385
Three.

32:18.465 --> 32:19.385
Two.

32:19.465 --> 32:20.705
One!

32:22.105 --> 32:23.305
Happy New Year!

32:25.465 --> 32:26.385
Are you out?

32:27.985 --> 32:30.625
I'm celebrating New Year's
with my friends.

32:31.465 --> 32:32.585
Happy New Year.

32:37.025 --> 32:40.665
I hope you and your friends
have a great time.

32:46.905 --> 32:49.745
If you're free tomorrow,
go to my place and check on my fish.

32:50.665 --> 32:51.865
You know the door code.

32:55.305 --> 32:56.505
Sure.

33:13.465 --> 33:15.105
-Happy New Year.
-Cheers.

33:15.185 --> 33:16.145
Happy New Year.

33:16.225 --> 33:18.865
I'm glad I have you guys. Thank you.

33:19.665 --> 33:20.785
Feeling better now?

33:25.585 --> 33:26.985
To the New Year!

33:29.785 --> 33:30.985
Do you think

33:32.505 --> 33:34.425
Switzerland is cold?

33:34.505 --> 33:35.345
Switzerland?

33:36.305 --> 33:37.385
It's not too bad.

33:37.465 --> 33:38.945
It has a temperate monsoon climate.

33:39.025 --> 33:44.865
Compared with Harbin,
Switzerland is just cool.

33:45.665 --> 33:46.505
Right.

33:47.985 --> 33:50.385
Then I must be a fake Harbin native.

33:50.465 --> 33:51.585
I'm really sensitive to the cold.

33:51.665 --> 33:54.825
Every winter, I wear layer after layer.

33:54.905 --> 33:55.825
That's good.

33:56.345 --> 33:57.585
You know how to keep warm.

33:59.225 --> 34:00.065
Come on.

34:00.145 --> 34:01.265
Happy New Year.

34:01.345 --> 34:02.545
Happy New Year.

34:21.784 --> 34:23.545
BAR

34:28.264 --> 34:30.705
Verified. Please open the door.

34:36.865 --> 34:39.985
Luke, how should I take care of your fish?

34:40.905 --> 34:42.185
Listen carefully and do exactly as I say.

34:48.425 --> 34:50.145
Replace the filter pad in the fish tank.

34:53.824 --> 34:55.744
The pads are in the cabinet
under the staghorn fern.

35:03.785 --> 35:05.145
There are gloves in the box.

35:05.225 --> 35:06.065
LUAN NIAN

35:09.145 --> 35:12.545
Open the cabinet under the tank
and find the filter first.

35:15.625 --> 35:17.625
Take out the old filter pad,

35:17.705 --> 35:18.785
then put the new one in.

35:24.345 --> 35:25.985
Check the thermometer beside it.

35:27.305 --> 35:29.625
Make sure the water temperature is right,
then add a little fish food.

35:31.185 --> 35:32.305
Luan Nian, come.

35:33.825 --> 35:34.785
Just follow my instructions.

35:35.545 --> 35:36.745
I'm hanging up.

36:12.225 --> 36:14.305
Verified. Please open the door.

36:38.145 --> 36:40.185
I hope you and the fish

36:40.265 --> 36:43.825
get everything you wish for
in the new year.

36:54.545 --> 36:55.585
TAN MIAN

36:56.985 --> 36:57.825
Hello?

36:57.905 --> 36:59.625
Seriously?

36:59.705 --> 37:02.225
We woke up
and were told you'd checked out.

37:02.305 --> 37:03.185
You're back in Beijing?

37:04.265 --> 37:05.385
Yeah.

37:05.465 --> 37:07.705
Did you go to see Ms. Shang?

37:07.785 --> 37:08.905
None of your business.

38:16.785 --> 38:21.185
POSTS ABOUT SWITZERLAND

38:31.105 --> 38:31.945
ZANG YAO: VISIT SWITZERLAND
WITH THE PEOPLE YOU LOVE AT LEAST ONCE

38:32.025 --> 38:33.145
GET A LITTLE TIPSY, LOOK AT ONE ANOTHER
AND SAY, "LET'S STAY TOGETHER FOREVER."

38:52.105 --> 38:53.225
I…

38:55.305 --> 38:56.305
I'm in a relationship

38:57.785 --> 38:59.185
that isn't right.

39:00.345 --> 39:03.465
I always thought
I didn't care how it'd end

39:04.465 --> 39:10.745
or that I never expected a happy ending.

39:12.305 --> 39:13.945
But that isn't true.

39:16.825 --> 39:17.705
I'm…

39:18.425 --> 39:19.505
I'm awful.

39:19.585 --> 39:20.825
You're not awful.

39:26.585 --> 39:27.705
You're still young.

39:29.065 --> 39:30.785
Being young means you have
the chance to make mistakes.

39:32.065 --> 39:33.745
Never settle for less than you deserve.

39:35.105 --> 39:36.945
I believe you have the courage
to break out of your shell.

39:38.425 --> 39:39.785
Even if you don't yet,

39:40.545 --> 39:41.865
you will someday.

40:00.385 --> 40:01.865
Shang Zhitao, I'm coming to see you now.

40:13.345 --> 40:17.865
The classic childhood sweetheart.

40:17.945 --> 40:20.385
You can tell at a glance
she and Luke move in the same circles.

40:20.465 --> 40:23.505
Do you think they're really dating?

40:32.425 --> 40:33.945
Aren't you cold dressed like this?

40:38.425 --> 40:40.025
This is from the ski resort.

40:44.145 --> 40:45.185
I don't know how to snowboard.

40:47.065 --> 40:48.145
You can learn.

40:56.705 --> 40:58.025
I've realized…

41:01.305 --> 41:03.265
we're from completely different worlds.

41:09.505 --> 41:11.265
I don't know how to snowboard,

41:11.345 --> 41:13.145
and I don't want to learn for now

41:13.745 --> 41:15.745
because the ski passes are expensive.

41:16.665 --> 41:18.985
And I certainly wouldn't go
to Switzerland just to snowboard.

41:19.825 --> 41:23.385
Sorry to let
such an expensive gift go to waste.

41:28.265 --> 41:30.705
Are you still upset
about what happened at work?

41:32.225 --> 41:36.105
Didn't you say we should keep things
strictly professional at work?

41:36.705 --> 41:38.905
If you're unhappy with the way
I handled it, you can talk to me.

41:38.985 --> 41:41.105
Why bring it into our relationship?

41:42.785 --> 41:44.505
This isn't about work.

41:48.665 --> 41:50.025
You said before

41:51.305 --> 41:54.065
that if either of us
stopped liking the other,

41:54.145 --> 41:55.465
we could end things.

42:01.305 --> 42:02.585
Is there someone else?

42:03.345 --> 42:04.345
No.

42:04.425 --> 42:06.185
Then what do you mean? Just say it.

42:08.265 --> 42:09.505
I mean,

42:10.345 --> 42:13.025
if you start seeing someone else,
you have to tell me.

42:16.665 --> 42:18.425
You must be delusional.

42:18.505 --> 42:20.145
Do you think I sleep
with someone everywhere I go?

42:20.225 --> 42:22.265
Do you think every woman
I meet is after me?

43:01.625 --> 43:02.985
Are you all right?

43:03.065 --> 43:04.145
Let me see.

43:06.385 --> 43:08.545
Good grief. Your forehead's
hot enough to fry an egg.

43:08.625 --> 43:09.905
You have a fever.

43:11.585 --> 43:13.025
I do feel a little warm.

43:15.625 --> 43:16.745
Go home right now.
Why are you still working?

43:16.825 --> 43:18.665
-Go.
-I haven't filed for sick leave yet.

43:18.745 --> 43:20.025
Don't worry about it.

43:20.105 --> 43:22.745
I've got a stack of sick leave forms
in my drawer. Go home.

43:54.985 --> 43:57.145
LUAN NIAN

44:10.305 --> 44:12.225
Lumi says you have a fever.

44:12.745 --> 44:13.905
Is it bad?

44:13.985 --> 44:15.025
Have you been to the hospital?

44:15.625 --> 44:17.505
Do you want me to come over now?

44:17.585 --> 44:18.705
Answer me.

44:26.145 --> 44:28.145
LUAN NIAN

44:33.065 --> 44:34.105
Open the door.

45:08.425 --> 45:09.465
Don't take pictures.

45:10.145 --> 45:11.105
These aren't for you.

45:11.705 --> 45:13.465
I don't care who they're for.

45:13.545 --> 45:14.545
First come, first served.

45:15.985 --> 45:18.265
There isn't a love letter
in here, is there?

45:20.665 --> 45:22.505
Buy your own if you like them.

45:24.985 --> 45:27.225
You're no fun.

45:27.305 --> 45:28.785
It's just a bouquet.

45:29.385 --> 45:31.385
If I take it,
you can just buy another one.

45:32.345 --> 45:35.425
And here I was planning to invite you over
for a housewarming dinner tonight.

45:36.385 --> 45:37.905
I just learned on my phone

45:37.985 --> 45:40.105
how to make egg fried rice.

45:40.185 --> 45:42.025
I was going to show off my skills.

45:42.105 --> 45:44.825
Go to Tan Mian's restaurant
if you want something to eat.

45:44.905 --> 45:47.585
If you burn down the courtyard house,
I can't afford to pay for it.

45:49.905 --> 45:51.465
You'd even cover the damages for me?

45:52.785 --> 45:54.025
That alone proves

45:54.105 --> 45:57.145
all these years of friendship
weren't for nothing.

45:57.745 --> 45:58.745
By the way,

45:58.825 --> 46:01.425
I've talked to Song, Tan Mian,
and the others.

46:01.505 --> 46:05.265
How about we take
our annual trip over New Year's

46:05.345 --> 46:07.185
and go snowboarding in Northern Europe?

46:08.465 --> 46:10.825
I've already set the dates.
You can't miss it.

46:13.985 --> 46:16.865
You won't have that much work
over New Year's, will you?

46:19.665 --> 46:20.505
We'll see.

46:21.585 --> 46:23.745
No. You have to come.

46:26.225 --> 46:27.385
It's almost time.

46:28.745 --> 46:30.985
Get ready. We should go.

46:31.065 --> 46:32.385
I'm going to the restroom.

46:43.705 --> 46:46.505
TO SHANG ZHITAO: HAVE YOU LEFT?
